        "title": "NOTUA – the most powerful creative planning & mind-map app.",
        "text": "Plan projects, sort ideas and connect them on one endless board: notes, tables, tasks, widgets and boards inside boards. Made by me – free to use.",
        "endTitle": "Built, shipped, free to use.",
        "endText": "Runs in the browser, as a desktop app and on Android.",
        "linkText": "open NOTUA ↗",
